WEBVTT

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.625
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:20.667
<i>Between us half-demon twins, </i>
<i> two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.208
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.708
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.125
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:28.833
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:30.708
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:32.542
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:35.458
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.250
<i>A Feudal Fairytale, </i>
<i> Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:43.500
<i>We'll keep moving forward </i>
<i> through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:57.167
From the gate of surprise,
to the gate of death.

00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:00.417
Wait, okay, calm down.

00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:07.083
I smell Setsuna's blood.

00:01:11.417 --> 00:01:16.250
Setsuna!

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:17.667
Behind me?

00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:18.750
Setsuna!

00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:22.417
Why are you behind me?
I haven't moved at all.

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:28.250
Konton's spell twists the space around us
and it's making us go in circles.

00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:30.292
She disappeared.

00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:31.708
It's a Mobius strip.

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:32.708
A what?

00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:36.375
If we can't physically escape this trap,

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:39.292
we just have to sever the circle itself.

00:01:40.042 --> 00:01:42.750
If you want me to cut something,
I can, but where?

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:47.125
I don't know if we can see it,
but is there a nexus for it somewhere?

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:50.375
We can see it if it's a rift of demon energy.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.042
What does that mean?

00:01:52.875 --> 00:01:59.125
I heard that our clan can sniff out
where rifts of demon energies clash.

00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:00.792
And we can cut through that.

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:02.792
Sniff out?

00:02:03.417 --> 00:02:04.458
I'll try it.

00:02:20.542 --> 00:02:21.500
This smell.

00:02:21.792 --> 00:02:23.042
Konton!

00:02:39.542 --> 00:02:40.583
He's close.

00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:41.500
Yeah.

00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:44.458
What?

00:02:51.042 --> 00:02:52.000
How dare you.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.042
Distasteful.

00:04:35.292 --> 00:04:37.375
"Sesshomaru and Kirinmaru"

00:04:39.208 --> 00:04:41.167
SETSUNA           TOWA HIGURASHI
Did you just say "distasteful"?

00:04:41.167 --> 00:04:43.167
SETSUNA           TOWA HIGURASHI
You're the one who trapped us!

00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:45.167
Where is Kirinmaru?

00:04:45.167 --> 00:04:48.500
And what business would you have
with Lord Kirinmaru?

00:04:48.792 --> 00:04:50.625
I'm looking for the Dream Butterfly.

00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:53.500
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – KONTON
The Dream Butterfly, you say?

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:02.125
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
Damn, it's windy.

00:05:08.292 --> 00:05:10.750
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – TOTETSU
Ow, what the hell?

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:13.500
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – TOTETSU
Hey, is that you, Totetsu?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.333
And up we go.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.292
Did Konton mess up or something?

00:05:18.292 --> 00:05:21.167
Oh well, I'll turn you into namasu!

00:05:22.417 --> 00:05:24.083
And I'll just take your head!

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:32.292
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE – RIKU

00:05:37.292 --> 00:05:40.250
RACCOON DOG DEMON – TAKECHIYO
Oh no, something must've happened inside.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.833
Lord Riku?

00:05:46.083 --> 00:05:47.625
You wait here.

00:05:51.208 --> 00:05:54.417
But I want to go home...

00:05:57.125 --> 00:05:58.500
What are you laughing at?

00:05:58.792 --> 00:06:03.167
It's just that you two seem to have
no idea what you're doing.

00:06:03.417 --> 00:06:05.750
What? What do you mean?

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:07.208
The two of you...

00:06:07.208 --> 00:06:10.708
are chasing the Dream Butterfly
without even understanding

00:06:10.708 --> 00:06:13.250
Lord Kirinmaru's profound designs for it.

00:06:13.667 --> 00:06:18.125
Who cares about that? If Kirinmaru
is the one controlling the Dream Butterfly,

00:06:18.125 --> 00:06:20.583
then I'll get Setsuna's dreams back from him!

00:06:20.917 --> 00:06:24.833
Oh, my. How ignorant you are,
half-demons.

00:06:28.875 --> 00:06:30.500
KONTON'S SHIKIGAMI
WIND LION           THUNDER LION

00:06:40.917 --> 00:06:43.875
The Gold and Silver Rainbow Pearls...

00:06:49.958 --> 00:06:51.292
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:06:55.833 --> 00:06:57.083
How's that?

00:06:57.167 --> 00:07:03.500
Who cares? I just don't want
Lord Kirinmaru to be angry with me.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.042
This tastes gross, but...

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.500
Why don't you stop stalling?

00:07:18.625 --> 00:07:21.958
This Rainbow Pearl works really well.

00:07:34.667 --> 00:07:36.833
You've been housing them in your eyes,

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.833
yet you probably don't even
know their origins.

00:07:40.208 --> 00:07:42.083
The origins of the Rainbow Pearls?

00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:45.667
The seven combined form
a power that should not exist,

00:07:45.667 --> 00:07:48.458
so Lady Zero
scattered them across the lands.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:52.167
For you both to possess them
simply spells disaster.

00:07:59.125 --> 00:08:00.125
Come, Ogre!

00:08:03.625 --> 00:08:05.458
KONTON'S SHIKIGAMI – BLUE OGRE

00:08:05.833 --> 00:08:07.750
Scourge of Swallows!

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:15.250
This is...

00:08:17.333 --> 00:08:18.625
It's something like a puppet.

00:08:19.042 --> 00:08:21.125
Then we aim for the puppeteer.

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:27.292
Above you, Towa.

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:36.167
<i>You two are still within </i>
<i> the eight field escape trap.</i>

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:41.250
<i>You're still in the palm of my hand.</i>

00:08:41.583 --> 00:08:44.083
Damn it, where is he?

00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:46.500
Sniff it out, Towa.

00:08:47.417 --> 00:08:50.500
Sniff it out? The flow of demon energy?

00:08:54.625 --> 00:08:56.000
A vortex of demon energy?

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:58.750
Here it comes!

00:08:59.667 --> 00:09:01.458
– What?
– There!

00:09:06.875 --> 00:09:07.792
How dare you.

00:09:08.167 --> 00:09:13.708
Give it up already. I just want to know
where Kirinmaru is. If you just tell me...

00:09:13.708 --> 00:09:16.042
Do not underestimate me, little girl.

00:09:21.708 --> 00:09:22.792
Setsuna!

00:09:27.958 --> 00:09:28.958
Dodge it!

00:09:30.375 --> 00:09:32.083
Cyclone Burst!

00:09:51.417 --> 00:09:52.792
What happened?

00:09:52.917 --> 00:09:54.042
Where...

00:10:01.292 --> 00:10:02.417
Moroha.

00:10:03.833 --> 00:10:04.917
What?

00:10:05.833 --> 00:10:09.458
Looks like Konton's
eight field whatever is gone now.

00:10:09.958 --> 00:10:12.458
You're the only one left of the Four Perils.

00:10:12.458 --> 00:10:14.333
Tell me, where is Kirinmaru?

00:10:24.792 --> 00:10:27.208
Come on, time to give up, Totetsu.

00:10:30.875 --> 00:10:31.750
What?

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.375
I won't let you get away.

00:10:39.708 --> 00:10:41.458
Takechiyo!

00:10:41.833 --> 00:10:43.667
Why are you just standing there?

00:10:43.667 --> 00:10:46.125
I didn't do anything wrong.

00:10:46.792 --> 00:10:49.250
We're going after him.
Hurry up and transform!

00:10:59.083 --> 00:11:01.375
And that's three.

00:11:02.625 --> 00:11:04.458
Get back here!

00:11:05.083 --> 00:11:07.125
Can't you go any faster?

00:11:08.333 --> 00:11:10.333
We kind of left Riku behind.

00:11:10.333 --> 00:11:12.792
There's no time to worry about him.

00:11:12.917 --> 00:11:16.333
Oh, that's right, you two
defeated Konton, right?

00:11:16.333 --> 00:11:18.500
Where's his head?

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:20.875
There is no head. It was eaten up.

00:11:20.875 --> 00:11:21.750
Why?

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.208
You have the time to worry about that?

00:11:31.708 --> 00:11:34.167
BEAST KING RULING
THE FOUR PERILS – KIRINMARU

00:11:38.792 --> 00:11:40.792
Is he planning to run to the seas?

00:11:40.792 --> 00:11:43.083
All of his friends have been defeated,

00:11:43.083 --> 00:11:47.167
so he must be running for help
to his higher-up, Kirinmaru.

00:11:47.167 --> 00:11:48.292
Higher-up?

00:11:48.292 --> 00:11:49.750
Someone above his rank.

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:51.792
Then that'd be the boss, wouldn't it?

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.417
How many mon coins do you think
that Kirinmaru boss is worth?

00:11:56.667 --> 00:11:59.667
Damn them. Just you wait.

00:12:04.167 --> 00:12:05.125
What?

00:12:05.125 --> 00:12:06.125
What's going on?

00:12:07.625 --> 00:12:11.500
Fool. Do you intend to invite
unnecessary guests to my ship?

00:12:12.708 --> 00:12:14.708
I'm terribly sorry.

00:12:14.708 --> 00:12:15.708
Be gone.

00:12:17.625 --> 00:12:19.167
Come back here, Totetsu!

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.875
Who the hell are you?

00:12:34.042 --> 00:12:35.958
I am Kirinmaru.

00:12:49.042 --> 00:12:50.708
Who the hell are you?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.583
I am Kirinmaru.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:58.208
Oh, really? So you're the
big boss man of the Four Perils!

00:12:58.667 --> 00:13:00.250
Prepare yourself!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.375
Wait, Moroha.

00:13:02.208 --> 00:13:04.500
Are you the one controlling
the Dream Butterfly?

00:13:06.875 --> 00:13:10.583
And if you've stolen Setsuna's dreams,
please return them.

00:13:10.667 --> 00:13:15.750
Hey, let's just take them back by force.
But I get dibs on his head.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.208
Is there even a bounty out for Kirinmaru?

00:13:18.208 --> 00:13:20.125
Huh? Takechiyo.

00:13:20.833 --> 00:13:21.958
What is it?

00:13:21.958 --> 00:13:23.250
You'd know, wouldn't you?

00:13:23.833 --> 00:13:26.250
I don't think anyone put a bounty out for him.

00:13:26.708 --> 00:13:29.958
And the Tree of Ages never said
we'd get anything for it.

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.417
I'll pass, then.

00:13:32.417 --> 00:13:35.958
Wait, we still need to settle
the whole Dream Butterfly thing.

00:13:37.083 --> 00:13:39.083
Listen, half-demons.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:43.708
You want my head?
Then go ahead and try.

00:13:43.833 --> 00:13:46.292
I'd rather not work for free, thanks.

00:13:46.375 --> 00:13:49.708
Kill me, and the Dream Butterfly
will disappear.

00:13:49.708 --> 00:13:53.625
Um, if you could just make it disappear
without you having to die...

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.250
Half-demons!

00:13:57.375 --> 00:14:01.917
There exists a prophecy that half-demons
will be the ones to take my head.

00:14:02.125 --> 00:14:07.625
I must find out if this is true or false,
else my conscience will not be at ease.

00:14:10.917 --> 00:14:15.875
Regardless, you half-demons
are not meant to exist in this world at all.

00:14:16.292 --> 00:14:19.750
Half-demon this, half-demon that.
Just shut up already!

00:14:24.875 --> 00:14:25.958
Moroha.

00:14:25.958 --> 00:14:29.042
Not even a skill or spell to behold.

00:14:29.625 --> 00:14:33.708
You wanna see some skills?
Eat this. Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:14:37.167 --> 00:14:38.000
Did he...

00:14:40.292 --> 00:14:41.167
What?

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.708
I think we'd better slay him.

00:14:46.083 --> 00:14:47.292
Setsuna!

00:14:52.292 --> 00:14:54.625
I see. You can absorb demon energy.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.875
I'll be taking all of it.

00:15:01.042 --> 00:15:04.083
However, you're lacking in strength.

00:15:04.542 --> 00:15:08.125
Demon energy, Towa!
Cut the flow of demon energy.

00:15:08.125 --> 00:15:09.167
Okay.

00:15:10.417 --> 00:15:11.583
Wait...

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:14.333
I can't sense it.

00:15:17.458 --> 00:15:20.667
My demon energy cannot be
sensed by the likes of you.

00:15:21.333 --> 00:15:24.458
Heart, skill, strength,
all so lacking.

00:15:24.667 --> 00:15:26.708
Was the prophecy false?

00:15:27.333 --> 00:15:33.542
Or perhaps are you not the half-demons
who are fated to take my life?

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:36.375
You two, stay back.

00:15:41.417 --> 00:15:45.792
With this rouge, I become Beniyasha,
Destroyer of Lands!

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:54.167
Tremble before the bloodthirsty dawn!
Bear witness to your end, if you so dare!!

00:15:54.417 --> 00:15:56.417
Iron-Reaver, Soul-Stealer!

00:15:59.292 --> 00:16:00.167
Damn it.

00:16:00.625 --> 00:16:02.083
Iron-Reaver, Soul-Stealer!

00:16:05.667 --> 00:16:08.500
You seem to have gotten a bit stronger...

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.250
Moroha!

00:16:12.708 --> 00:16:14.125
Blades of Blood!

00:16:18.167 --> 00:16:20.042
But your skills cannot catch up.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.000
Moroha!

00:16:26.208 --> 00:16:28.250
You cannot even maintain that form!

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:34.667
I still have not used any skills or spells.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.417
But here, have a glimpse.

00:16:46.542 --> 00:16:47.542
Setsuna!

00:16:53.792 --> 00:16:55.042
Disappointing.

00:16:55.042 --> 00:16:57.208
Stop it!

00:17:09.375 --> 00:17:11.375
As expected of his grandchild.

00:17:12.333 --> 00:17:14.250
Sesshomaru's daughter...

00:17:15.458 --> 00:17:16.542
However...

00:17:22.208 --> 00:17:23.125
Towa!

00:17:24.167 --> 00:17:25.750
I tire of you.

00:17:38.875 --> 00:17:39.875
Who...

00:17:39.875 --> 00:17:40.792
...is that?

00:17:45.333 --> 00:17:47.625
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S FATHER –
SESSHOMARU

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:54.500
Sesshomaru, so you have
compassion as a parent after all.

00:17:55.125 --> 00:17:57.625
That person is Sesshomaru?

00:17:57.875 --> 00:18:02.375
Have you come here to stop me
out of concern for your daughters' lives?

00:18:02.375 --> 00:18:04.167
Lord Kirinmaru!

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:06.625
SESSHOMARU'S VASSAL – JAKEN
Lord Sesshomaru

00:18:06.625 --> 00:18:10.125
is not the kind who would
take action for personal matters.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:11.917
Silence, Jaken.

00:18:11.917 --> 00:18:13.000
Yes, sir.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.250
Step back.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.500
Yes, sir.

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:22.792
Oh, look at how much
you two have grown!

00:18:24.042 --> 00:18:25.000
Who are you?

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:27.875
Of course the heavens and earth
would resound when we cross each other.

00:19:29.125 --> 00:19:34.500
It seems your daughters are not
sufficient enough to threaten my life.

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:41.583
However, Sesshomaru, I will still have you
work for what I desire you to do.

00:19:52.083 --> 00:19:53.500
Lord Sesshomaru.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.875
We're leaving, Jaken.

00:19:56.417 --> 00:20:01.042
But I don't think we should
leave these two like this.

00:20:03.667 --> 00:20:04.667
Jaken.

00:20:05.458 --> 00:20:06.750
Yes?

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:07.708
Do not say it.

00:20:07.708 --> 00:20:12.542
Yes, sir. Oh, please wait for me,
Lord Sesshomaru!

00:20:18.042 --> 00:20:20.917
I will not give the Rainbow Pearls to anyone.

00:20:22.375 --> 00:20:23.917
As for the remaining...

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:26.250
I'll have them all.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.417
Towa! Setsuna!

00:20:39.208 --> 00:20:40.417
Hey!

00:20:41.208 --> 00:20:42.333
You're alive!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.292
Setsuna. Setsuna!

00:20:48.875 --> 00:20:49.792
Moroha?

00:20:49.792 --> 00:20:51.792
Good, you're alive.

00:20:53.375 --> 00:20:58.125
So what happened?
Did you two defeat Kirinmaru?

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:59.458
No.

00:20:59.458 --> 00:21:02.917
It was Sesshomaru.
Sesshomaru showed up.

00:21:02.917 --> 00:21:04.292
Sesshomaru?

00:21:05.042 --> 00:21:07.708
You mean your dad?
What happened?

00:21:07.833 --> 00:21:12.333
I don't know. But it looks like
he has something to do with Kirinmaru.

00:21:26.042 --> 00:21:30.583
Hey, show yourself.
Why don't you say something, huh?

00:21:31.042 --> 00:21:32.833
It's no use, damn it.

00:21:36.167 --> 00:21:38.458
We really can't do much like this.

00:21:39.292 --> 00:21:40.292
Yeah.

00:21:49.917 --> 00:21:52.917
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S MOTHER – RIN

00:21:57.083 --> 00:22:01.792
<i>I wonder what Sesshomaru is trying to do.</i>

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:45.375
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:45.458 --> 00:23:49.125
Demon slayers!
It was I who summoned you.

00:23:49.500 --> 00:23:52.917
Hisui accepts a challenge between
the demon slayers and bounty hunters.

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:54.542
Don't tell Towa.

00:23:54.542 --> 00:23:56.917
Aren't they going too far with this?

00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:59.625
Why are Moroha and Setsuna
fighting each other?!

00:23:59.625 --> 00:24:02.958
I'm the one who'll win.
I accepted the job, so I'll see it through!

00:24:03.417 --> 00:24:07.208
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"Princess Aiya's Beniyasha Hunting"

00:24:07.208 --> 00:24:23.936
Towa, if you get in my way,
I will have to defeat you, too!
